        "text": "We had an exceptional experience working with Cynthia to buy our house. She went above and beyond to make the entire process seamless and stress-free, and always ensured we were looped in and aware of next steps. Her expertise, dedication, and attention to detail were also outstanding!\n\nWe couldn’t have asked for a better realtor, highly recommend 🙂",
