        "text": "We are thrilled to have purchased our first home with the invaluable help of Christian from the St Denis Bouchard team. Christian is incredibly passionate, kind, and thorough, and he guided us through every step of the process with care and trust. His respectful and honest approach made the often daunting task of buying a home a breeze, even in these challenging times. We couldn’t have asked for a better experience!",
